# Slice 283 probe: what a callable's parts name at run time: a free holder reads `var` and `body` by name, then a field below them.  Entry 7.
Callables:
    fn: f () int
        int: x 3
        return: x
    end: f
end: Callables
int: Hc 0
fn: read_var_size () int
    @: part Hc\f\var
    return: 1
end: read_var_size
fn: read_body_x () int
    return: Hc\f\body\x
end: read_body_x
fn: through_var () int
    @: Hc Callables Callables
    return: read_var_size()
end: through_var
fn: through_body () int
    @: Hc Callables Callables
    return: read_body_x()
end: through_body
int: code 7
if: through_var() != 1
    code: 11
---
if: code = 7 && through_body() != 3
    code: 12
---
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
catch: implements ()
    sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 41; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
end: implements
return
